{"version":1,"content":"\n<p>MaScanner 是 QR 碼與條碼掃描工具，適合需要快速讀取、整理及匯出掃描紀錄的使用者。原價 US $0.99，現時<a href=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/category/apps-%E6%83%85%E5%A0%B1/%E9%99%90%E6%99%82%E5%85%8D%E8%B2%BB%E6%83%85%E5%A0%B1/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">限時免費</a>；掃描紀錄留在裝置，毋須帳戶，亦不設分析或雲端同步。</p>\n<figure><img alt=\"限時免費\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"460\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/460x460Icon-Ap-SiOS01-75-74.webp\" width=\"460\"/></figure>\n<h2>掃描紀錄集中管理</h2>\n<p>以相機掃描 QR 碼及多種常見條碼，支援批次模式、相片庫讀取 QR 碼、變焦與閃光燈，並可設定聲音或震動提示。掃描結果可辨識網址、Wi-Fi、電郵、電話、短訊、產品碼及純文字，支援複製、分享、加入私人備註、搜尋篩選、收藏，以及匯出全部或指定紀錄至 CSV。</p>\n<figure><figure><img alt=\"App Screenshot\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"1183\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/2778x1284bb-11-scaled.jpg\" width=\"2560\"/></figure><figure><img alt=\"App Screenshot\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"1183\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/2778x1284bb-12-scaled.jpg\" width=\"2560\"/></figure><figure><img alt=\"App Screenshot\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"1183\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/2778x1284bb-13-scaled.jpg\" width=\"2560\"/></figure><figure><img alt=\"App Screenshot\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"1183\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/2778x1284bb-14-scaled.jpg\" width=\"2560\"/></figure><figure><img alt=\"App Screenshot\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"1183\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/2778x1284bb-15-scaled.jpg\" width=\"2560\"/></figure><figure><img alt=\"App Screenshot\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"1183\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/2778x1284bb-16-scaled.jpg\" width=\"2560\"/></figure></figure>\n<ul><li>應用名稱：MaScanner</li><li>應用類別：Utilities</li><li>下載位置：<a href=\"https://apps.apple.com/app/mascanner/id6812075556?uo=4\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">App Store</a></li></ul>\n","scraped_at":"2026-10-24T13:02:33.529764+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":277,"images":7,"source":"New MobileLife","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-10-24T12:56:22+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-24T21:38:15.425042+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-24T12:58:23.326465+00:00","content_hash":"ba7ac87b2661cec5d60d6e9872f9b3cbc4a2fc81616bb1f35004bb1aa34e538e","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}